:: Isabel - secret meeting 4 [bg-underground]
<h1 class="ptitle">NIGHTCLUB WC</h1>
<br />

<<isabelNpcInit>>
<<set $characters.isabel.relationship = Math.min(($characters.isabel.relationship ?? 0) + 15, 100)>>

She locked the door this time before either of you said a word.

<br /><br />

<center>
	<<image 'people/isabel/meeting4_resolved.jpg' sfw>>
</center>
<br />

<<isabel>>
	I've made up my mind. I want him gone. Not talked down, not sidelined — gone. And I want you to be the one who does it.
<</isabel>>
<br />

<<you>>
	Why me?
<</you>>
<br />
<<isabel>>
	Because you're the only person in this city who ever told him no and lived. Because I've watched you long enough to know you'll actually go through with it. And because after everything he's taken, I want to be the one who hands him his ending.
<</isabel>>
<br />
<div id="mtg4_accept">
<<linkreplace 'Pull her to you'>>
	<<run $('#mtg4_decline').hide()>>
	<<set $characters.isabel.quests.hadSex = true>>
	She closed the distance between you, no hesitation left in her at all. This time there was no rush to it — she pulled you against the wall slower than before, wrapped one leg up around your hip, and pulled you inside her like she wanted to feel every inch of it.

	<br /><br />

	<<video 'isabel/nightclub1'>>
	<br /><br />

	<<isabel>>
		When it's done, this city is yours. I'll make sure of it.
	<</isabel>>
	<br />

	There was nothing careful about it after that — no listening for footsteps, no watching the door. Just the two of you, pressed against the wall, and the plan neither of you said out loud again until it was over.

	<br /><br />
	<div id="mtg4_finish">
		<<linkreplace 'Finish inside her'>>
			<<run $('#mtg4_finish_out').hide()>>
			<<set _mtg4Preg = setup.pregnancyChance($characters.isabel)>>
			<<if _mtg4Preg>>
				<<set $characters.isabel.pregnancy = 0>>
				<<set $characters.isabel.pregnancy_father = 'mc'>>
			<</if>>
			You didn't pull back this time. She held onto you tighter instead, like she wanted it that way.
			<br /><br />
			<<link 'Continue'>>
				<<goto 'Isabel - secret meeting 4 aftermath'>>
			<</link>>
		<</linkreplace>>
	</div>
	<div id="mtg4_finish_out">
		<<linkreplace 'Pull out'>>
			<<run $('#mtg4_finish').hide()>>
			You pulled back at the last moment. She didn't comment on it either way.
			<br /><br />
			<<link 'Continue'>>
				<<goto 'Isabel - secret meeting 4 aftermath'>>
			<</link>>
		<</linkreplace>>
	</div>
<</linkreplace>>
</div>
<div id="mtg4_decline">
<<linkreplace 'Just make the plan'>>
	<<run $('#mtg4_accept').hide()>>
	<<set $characters.isabel.quests.declinedSex = true>>
	She stepped close, but you put a steady hand on her shoulder instead and kept her there.
	<br /><br />
	<<you>>
		Then let’s do this properly. Tell me where he sleeps, who guards him, and when.
	<</you>>
	<br />
	She held your gaze for a long moment, then nodded. In low, quick words she laid it out — the guard shifts, the back corridor, the hour Dom drank himself quiet.
	<br /><br />
	<<isabel>>
		When it’s done, this city is yours. I’ll make sure of it.
	<</isabel>>
	<br />
	<<link 'Continue'>>
		<<goto 'Isabel - secret meeting 4 aftermath'>>
	<</link>>
<</linkreplace>>
</div>
